classDiagram
    class FeedbackTicket {
        +Status status
        +Category category
        +DateTime closed_at
    }
    class Status {
        <<enumeration>>
        SUBMITTED
        CLASSIFIED
        PROCESSING
        VERIFIED
        CLOSED
    }
    class TicketWorkflowService {
        +classify(ticket, category, severity)
        +start_processing(ticket)
        +verify(ticket)
        +close(ticket)
        +allowed_transitions() 
    }
    class TicketAdmin {
        +actions
        +list_display
        +list_filter
        +search_fields
    }
    FeedbackTicket --> Status : status
    TicketAdmin ..> TicketWorkflowService : 调用
    TicketWorkflowService --> FeedbackTicket : 校验并流转
